      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "\\mathrm{b} 、 \\text {河流、流域（水系）主要污染指标的确定方法}",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/220"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0003": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0003",
      "blockid": "c5e34a3e7a377ddbee6fa158afb4f76a",
      "heading": "a、断面主要污染指标的确定方法",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "\\text{断面超标率} = \\frac {\\text {某评价指标超过III类标准的断面(点位)个数}}{\\text {断面(点位)总数}} \\times 100",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/226"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0004": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0004",
      "blockid": "371cbdf8af2dca039e705c7bcd9a48ed",
      "heading": "b、湖泊营养状态分级",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "\\begin{array}{l l} T L I (\\Sigma) <   3 0 & \\text {贫营养} \\\\ 3 0 \\leqslant T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 5 0 & \\text {中营养} \\\\ T L I (\\Sigma) > 5 0 & \\text {富营养} \\\\ 5 0 <   T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 6 0 & \\text {轻度富营养} \\\\ 6 0 <   T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 7 0 & \\text {中度富营养} \\\\ T L I (\\Sigma) > 7 0 & \\text {重度富营养} \\end{array}",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/239"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0005": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0005",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\Sigma) = \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {m} W j \\cdot T L I (j)",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/244"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0006": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0006",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "W j = \\frac {r _ {i j} ^ {2}}{\\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {m} r _ {i j} ^ {2}}",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/249"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0007": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0007",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\mathrm{chla}) = 1 0 (2. 5 + 1. 0 8 6 \\mathrm{lnchla})",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/255"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0008": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0008",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\mathrm{TP}) = 1 0 (9. 4 3 6 + 1. 6 2 4 \\ln \\mathrm{TP})",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/256"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0009": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0009",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\mathrm{TN}) = 1 0 (5. 4 5 3 + 1. 6 9 4 \\ln \\mathrm{TN})",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/257"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0010": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0010",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\mathrm{SD}) = 1 0 (5. 1 1 8 - 1. 9 4 \\ln \\mathrm{SD})",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/258"
    },
    "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0011": {
      "id": "eq-c1ce2d3294969747f017dfa68ff34a51-0011",
      "blockid": "e9e75396c82f97647b5c919c9519776c",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I \\left(\\mathrm{COD} _ {\\mathrm{Mn}}\\right) = 1 0 (0. 1 0 9 + 2. 6 6 1 \\ln \\mathrm{COD} _ {\\mathrm{Mn}})",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/259"
    }
  }
